{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/team/layout,_N_T_/team/page,_N_T_/team"}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><!--oweG6OEEJOkVD2LlWXnjh--><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/2a25918c5d8a5b08.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-a187ebefcdbd1c61.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/4bd1b696-c023c6e3521b1417.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/255-62902f04efbdd792.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/main-app-f10ca8562d68747b.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/214-628d75f432f1dabd.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/619-ba102abea3e3d0e4.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/239-d33310ddfa6356f4.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-33cb4717f9edc3d1.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/team/page-f02b531ff52c168c.js\" async=\"\"></script><title>Meet the Team | Lathrop Team</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Meet Diane, Shane, and Oliver Lathrop — a three-generation Fox Cities real estate team.\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><div class=\"page-transition-overlay\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"site\"><header class=\"site-header\"><a class=\"site-logo\" aria-label=\"Lathrop Team Home\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"Lathrop Team logo icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/logos/lathrop-logo-icon.jpg\"/><span class=\"site-logo-text\">LATHROP TEAM</span></a><nav class=\"site-nav\" aria-label=\"Main Navigation\"><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/buy\">Buy</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/sell\">Sell</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/home-valuation\">Home Valuation</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/communities\">Communities</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/reviews\">Reviews</a><a class=\"nav-link nav-link--active\" href=\"/team\">Team</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/about\">About</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></nav></header><main class=\"site-main\"><section class=\"page page-team\"><div class=\"\"><header class=\"section-heading\"><p class=\"section-eyebrow\">Meet the team</p><h2 class=\"section-title\">A family helping families</h2></header></div><div class=\"page-body\"><div class=\"\"><p>Diane, Shane, and Oliver Lathrop represent three generations in real estate. That depth shows up in how we price, how we negotiate, and how we support you through the process.</p></div><div class=\"\"><div class=\"team-grid\"><article class=\"team-card\"><div class=\"team-card-image-placeholder\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>D</span></div><div class=\"team-card-content\"><p class=\"section-eyebrow\">Realtor®</p><h3 class=\"team-name\">Diane Lathrop</h3><p class=\"team-license\">License #<!-- -->62326-94</p><p class=\"team-bio\">With over 35 years of experience in the Fox Cities market, Diane has helped hundreds of families buy and sell homes locally. Independent rankings place her in the top 0.17% of agents in Appleton, with 996 closed sales recorded on Zillow.</p><div class=\"team-contact\"><a href=\"mailto:diane@lathropteam.com\" class=\"link\">diane@lathropteam.com</a><a href=\"tel:9204289227\" class=\"link\">(920) 428-9227</a></div></div></article><article class=\"team-card\"><div class=\"team-card-image-placeholder\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>S</span></div><div class=\"team-card-content\"><p class=\"section-eyebrow\">Realtor®</p><h3 class=\"team-name\">Shane Lathrop</h3><p class=\"team-bio\">Shane has lived near the valley his entire life, giving him a nuanced understanding of how the Fox Cities market moves. Zillow tracks 444 team listings and sales under his profile, reflecting years of active work in pricing, marketing, and negotiation.</p><div class=\"team-contact\"><a href=\"mailto:shane@lathropteam.com\" class=\"link\">shane@lathropteam.com</a><a href=\"tel:9204280066\" class=\"link\">(920) 428-0066</a></div></div></article><article class=\"team-card\"><div class=\"team-card-image-placeholder\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>O</span></div><div class=\"team-card-content\"><p class=\"section-eyebrow\">Realtor®</p><h3 class=\"team-name\">Oliver Lathrop</h3><p class=\"team-license\">License #<!-- -->94-88364</p><p class=\"team-bio\">Oliver represents the third generation of the team and brings a modern perspective to marketing and client service. He has 45 recent sales tracked under his license and focuses on clear communication, detailed market research, and strong presentation.</p><div class=\"team-contact\"><a href=\"mailto:oliver@lathropteam.com\" class=\"link\">oliver@lathropteam.com</a><a href=\"tel:9208584424\" class=\"link\">(920) 858-4424</a></div></div></article></div></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"site-footer\"><div class=\"site-footer-grid\"><div class=\"footer-brand\"><div class=\"site-logo\"><img alt=\"Lathrop Team logo icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/logos/lathrop-logo-icon.jpg\"/><span class=\"site-logo-text\">LATHROP TEAM</span></div><p>Three-generation Fox Cities real estate team with a RealTrends verified record and 525+ five-star reviews.</p></div><div><strong>Contact</strong><p>Diane Lathrop · (920) 428-9227 · diane@lathropteam.com</p><p>Shane Lathrop · (920) 428-0066 · shane@lathropteam.com</p><p>Oliver Lathrop · (920) 858-4424 · oliver@lathropteam.com</p></div><div class=\"footer-kw\"><strong>Keller Williams Fox Cities</strong><p>517 N. Westhill Blvd, Appleton, WI</p><p>Each office is independently owned and operated.</p></div></div></footer></div><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-a187ebefcdbd1c61.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[245,[\\\"214\\\",\\\"static/chunks/214-628d75f432f1dabd.js\\\",\\\"619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/619-ba102abea3e3d0e4.js\\\",\\\"239\\\",\\\"static/chunks/239-d33310ddfa6356f4.js\\\",\\\"177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-33cb4717f9edc3d1.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n3:I[7831,[\\\"214\\\",\\\"static/chunks/214-628d75f432f1dabd.js\\\",\\\"619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/619-ba102abea3e3d0e4.js\\\",\\\"239\\\",\\\"static/chunks/239-d33310ddfa6356f4.js\\\",\\\"177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-33cb4717f9edc3d1.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[9766,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n5:I[8924,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n6:I[1356,[\\\"214\\\",\\\"static/chunks/214-628d75f432f1dabd.js\\\",\\\"619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/619-ba102abea3e3d0e4.js\\\",\\\"239\\\",\\\"static/chunks/239-d33310ddfa6356f4.js\\\",\\\"177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-33cb4717f9edc3d1.js\\\"],\\\"Image\\\"]\\n7:I[5413,[\\\"214\\\",\\\"static/chunks/214-628d75f432f1dabd.js\\\",\\\"898\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/team/page-f02b531ff52c168c.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\nd:I[7150,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/css/2a25918c5d8a5b08.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"0:{\\\"P\\\":null,\\\"b\\\":\\\"oweG6OEEJOkVD2LlWXnjh\\\",\\\"p\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"c\\\":[\\\"\\\",\\\"team\\\"],\\\"i\\\":false,\\\"f\\\":[[[\\\"\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"team\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"__PAGE__\\\",{}]}]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",true],[\\\"\\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"c\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"stylesheet\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/_next/static/css/2a25918c5d8a5b08.css\\\",\\\"precedence\\\":\\\"next\\\",\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"nonce\\\":\\\"$undefined\\